OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office drops licence case
OL,4,Aagainst restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant owner in York has said he
OL,7,Fis "very relieved and happy" after a
OL,8,Fbid by the Home Office to have his
OL,9,Flicence revoked was dropped.
OL,11,FAkwan Irani, the owner of Turkish
OL,12,Frestaurant Yakamoz, said he was not
OL,13,Fresponsible for the actions of its
OL,14,Fprevious owner who was fined #45,000
OL,15,Ffor employing an illegal worker.
OL,17,FRichard Garbutt, from the Home Office's
OL,18,FImmigration, Compliance and Enforcement
OL,19,F(ICE) department, said it recognised
OL,20,FIrani had not been involved with the
OL,21,Fbusiness when a raid took place at the
OL,22,Fpremises last year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
