OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office drops licence case
OL,4,Aagainst restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA City of York Council licensing
OL,7,Fhearing on Friday approved the
OL,8,Fdepartment's bid to add conditions to
OL,9,Fthe restaurant's licence after dropping
OL,10,Fits application to revoke it.
